  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "TinyFlags.Grpc 0.1.0-alpha.4\n\n      Added\n      - Reference gRPC transport: registration plus real-time push value synchronization over a Watch stream.\n      - Automatic reconnect on transient failures; permanent failures surface as TinyFlagsClientException.\n      - Strict response validation, consistent with the HTTP transport's failure classification (docs/grpc-protocol.md).\n\n      Fixed\n      - The README bundled in alpha.3 was a stale snapshot from before several docs fixes; this\n        release re-packs the current README.\n\n      Compatibility\n      - Early alpha, matches TinyFlags's contract version.\n      - Upgrade TinyFlags, TinyFlags.Http and TinyFlags.Grpc together.",
